<a href="https://www.ft.com/content/442bdba8-6f7e-4ddf-a99b-a8ba102d247f?syn-25a6b1a6=1&amp;ref=spyglass.org">they found someone who can do that</a>. Also, <a href="https://spyglass.org/failed-hackquisitions/">how have those
